{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CfeR7k1rPBDukr8n1cWKQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"VERDICT: LGTM\n\nThe change is additive and mirrors the existing `DuplicateTelephoneException` pattern end-to-end, which is exactly what a maintainer of this codebase would expect:\n\n- **Exception** — `DuplicateHouseholdException` is a near-exact sibling of `DuplicateTelephoneException` (same package, same `RuntimeException` base, constructor builds the message). Consistent and in the right unit.\n- **Exception handler** — the new `@ExceptionHandler` in `ExceptionControllerAdvice` follows the established handler shape (logging, `detailBuild`, `ResponseEntity.status`). Correct placement; this advice class is the right home and isn't becoming a catch-all beyond its existing role.\n- **Service logic** — the guard sits next to the existing telephone guard in `saveOwner`, and the matching/normalization are extracted into two well-named private helpers (`isDuplicateHousehold`, `normalizeHouseholdKey`) rather than inlined. Logic lives in the service layer, matching the stated invariant-in-one-place rationale.\n- **Entity flag** — `sharesHousehold` as a documented `@Transient`, write-only field is a reasonable home given this codebase maps the DTO directly onto the `Owner` entity; there's no DTO/entity split to put it elsewhere, and the OpenAPI schema marks it `writeOnly` to match.\n\nOne thing I considered but don't consider blocking: the sibling telephone check pushes existence down to the repository (`existsByTelephone`), whereas `isDuplicateHousehold` does `findAll().stream()` in the service. That divergence is a reasonable consequence of the normalization requirement (collapsed whitespace + case-insensitivity can't be expressed as a simple derived query), so the matching logic legitimately lives in the service. Structurally defensible, so no change requested."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9271,"cache_read_input_tokens":11894,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9271},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3cd8671b-e41c-4415-8439-ff7f8d8eb66f","uuid":"362715c0-cdc8-439b-b750-fcc05c6c9380","timestamp":"2026-10-03T01:14:14.264Z","request_id":"req_011CfeR7jnDnHx5udgo7YBNJ"}
